From 45dac1c6ae864db83ae51991080dec7c83c693f8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 20:05:29 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] klipper: allow naming starred items so they can be found by
 search

Starred items are often kept for things like account numbers whose
contents are hard to remember, so searching for them did not help. They
can now be given a name, which is shown above the text and is searched.

BUG: 488293
